      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "REGAL GYPSY (8) is generally an honest type in the frame at five of 16 starts but missed the placings last time when sixth (25.93) over 457m at this track. Form here at the trip sound including two wins. Boxed wide but will go close with the right run. ATOMIC PENNY (3) settled midfield in the run and boxed on to finish there when 4th (20.37) at this track. Has a good record here at this journey. Good beginner aided by a nice draw. Has the ability to give this a shake. LADY ELLOISE (7) is a fast dog well performed over the sprint races. Kept coming to finish seventh over 390m at this track (22.62) latest in a Grade 5. Form at the trip strong including seven wins. Has ability and a bold showing is expected. ROCKET ROXY (1) deserves plenty of thought over this distance.",
